"The answer is that it uses a table-driven generic parser (unless you specify "
"your own parser, as described in the {ref}`Extension Guide <Extension "
"Guide>`).  This parser maps literal strings to whatever type is required, "
"and requires you to tell it what this mapping should be."
msgstr ""

