"\"`OptLevel`\" enum type.  This variable can be assigned any of the values "
"that are listed in the declaration.  The CommandLine library enforces that "
"the user can only specify one of the options, and it ensure that only valid "
"enum values can be specified.  The \"`clEnumVal`\" macros ensure that the "
